    <sport:president>Don Garber (Commissioner)</sport:president>
    <sport:memberCount rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">29</sport:memberCount>
    <sport:description>MLS oversees North America's top soccer league. The league has grown from modest beginnings to attracting global superstars like Messi. MLS uses single-entity structure and salary cap, blending European soccer with American sports business models.</sport:description>
