    <sport:description>WADA coordinates the global fight against doping in sport. The agency establishes anti-doping standards, conducts testing programs, and maintains the Prohibited List. WADA's work ensures fair play and protects clean athletes worldwide.</sport:description>
    <sport:description xml:lang="en">International independent agency combating doping in sport</sport:description>
